[{"id":164129607,"discussion_id":"23c37b22d3292ca4b48af39511938bcbf9276d19","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-03-03T15:57:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-05T11:45:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164129623,"discussion_id":"0489df2159552af01217ecb0f7deb8ebdd224919","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n ji-jun1, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-03-03T15:57:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-03T15:57:51+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164129627,"discussion_id":"87088e3469d6a959678d039408e79775090e36e6","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-03T15:57:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-03T15:57:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164130112,"discussion_id":"da403086227062527f5853f6b37127b4b0930597","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要对量化更新散射（QuantUpdateScatter）算子内核代码进行了两项关键修改。首先，核心目的是增加对昇腾AscendC开发套件（ASC_DEVKIT）版本9及以上的兼容性支持，解决因头文件路径或名称变更导致的编译失败问题。其次，修正了计算目标张量全局内存偏移量的核心公式，解决了在特定数据维度下可能出现的地址计算错误，从而确保了算子功能的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案包含两部分。一是通过条件编译指令，根据预定义宏 `ASC_DEVKIT_MAJOR` 的版本号，动态选择包含 `basic_api/kernel_vec_intf.h`（版本>=9）或 `kernel_operator.h`（版本<9）头文件，以实现对不同版本开发环境的编译兼容。二是在 `CalcDstOffset` 函数中，将目标偏移量计算公式从 `(axisOffset + innerLoopIdx) * tilingData_.innerLoopEle` 修正为 `axisOffset * tilingData_.varDim3 + innerLoopIdx * tilingData_.innerLoopEle`，以准确反映张量内存布局，避免访存错误。","created_at":"2026-03-03T16:00:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-03T16:00:07+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164251910,"discussion_id":"ab1168d01b9025ca08efe68d9d39a6fb798baefb","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-04T15:07:11+08:00","u